                        <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,8" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                            <Run Text="在文字區域輸入數學算式，即時查看計算結果。" />
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock
                            Margin="0,0,0,4"
                            FontWeight="SemiBold"
                            Text="功能：" />
                        <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                            <Run Text="• 基本運算：+、-、*、/、%、**（次方）" />
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                            <Run Text="• Functions: sin, cos, tan, sqrt, abs, log, etc." />
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                            <Run Text="• Variables: x = 10" />
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                            <Run Text="• Constants: pi, e, tau, phi, sqrt2, sqrt3, sqrt5, ln2, ln10, log2e, log10e" />
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                            <Run Text="• 單位換算：5 miles to km、100°F to celsius" />
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                            <Run Text="• 日期計算：today + 5 days、5-14-26 - 1-12-25 in weeks" />
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock Margin="0,0,0,4" TextWrapping="Wrap">
                            <Run Text="• 支援的單位：長度、質量、溫度、體積、速度、面積、時間長度" />
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock
                            Margin="0,0,0,4"
                            FontWeight="SemiBold"
                            Text="範例：" />
                        <TextBlock
                            Margin="0,0,0,4"
                            FontFamily="Consolas"
                            FontSize="12"
                            TextWrapping="Wrap">
                            <Run Text="x = 10" /><LineBreak />
                            <Run Text="y = 20" /><LineBreak />
                            <Run Text="x + y" /><LineBreak />
                            <Run Text="sin(pi/2)" /><LineBreak />
                            <Run Text="sqrt(x * y)" />
                        </TextBlock>
                        <TextBlock
                            Margin="0,4,0,4"
                            FontFamily="Consolas"
                            FontSize="12"
